{
  "_comment": "The Zig that builds libghostty and the Linux daemons' C. tools/zig fetches exactly this build into ~/.cache/muster-zig/<version>/ and every Zig call in the repo goes through it, so a checkout carries its own compiler the way rust-toolchain.toml carries Rust: moving this pin rebuilds one checkout and breaks no other. libghostty requires a matching major and minor (its build.zig.zon's minimum_zig_version). Checksums are ziglang.org's, from https://ziglang.org/download/index.json.",
